<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps cuts Chile's Edelnor rate.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps cuts Chile's Edelnor rate.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Friday it lowered its rating of Empresa Electrica del Norte Grande's (Edelnor) senior unsecured notes to triple-B from triple-B-plus.</p>
<p>Edelnor is a Chilean electric generating and transmission company that supplies electricity under long-term purchase power agreements to distribution companies and large industrial consumers in Chile's Northern Interconnection System.</p>
</text>
